<title>USA: Stimsonite buys 77,500 of its shares.</title>
<headline>Stimsonite buys 77,500 of its shares.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stimsonite Corp said Tuesday that under a previously announced stock buyback program it has repurchased 77,500 shares of its common stock during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Through March 30, it purchased 326,000 shares at an average price of $7.13.</p>
<p>Stimsonite was off 1/4 at 5-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
